    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Sea Bliss Cottage by Oversee 30A | Perfect in Walton County Awards – Three-Time Diamond Winner – Best Rental Mgmt. 2026, 2025, 2024<br><br>Welcome to Sea Bliss Cottage, delightful getaway on Florida’s stunning Emerald Coast! Just a quick stroll to the lively 30Avenue shopping and dining district and half a mile from the stunning beaches, this two-story retreat is designed for relaxation and fun.<br><br>Highlights:<br>📍 Inlet Beach, next to 30Avenue’s dining scene!<br>👣 .6 miles to beach<br>👙 5-minute stroll to the seasonally heated community pool!<br>🛏️ 3 bedrooms, 2.5 baths<br>🚲 4 bikes<br>🍤 Gas grill<br>🦞 Great restaurants!<br>😎 Near Rosemary Beach and Alys Beach<br>🛍️ Cute shops and boutiques<br> <br>Inside, you’ll find an airy space filled with updated furniture and new flooring, making it a cozy spot to kick back. The spacious living area features updated furniture and new flooring, creating a cozy spot to unwind after a day of adventures.<br> <br>The kitchen comes fully equipped with stainless steel appliances, granite countertops, and a breakfast bar for extra seating. The dining area flows right out to a furnished deck where a gas grill awaits for your evening cookout. Dine outside or simply enjoy the coastal breeze.<br><br>During your stay, enjoy access to a seasonally heated community pool, a refreshing break after a day at the beach!<br><br>You’re also steps away from 30Avenue’s dining scene. Indulge in gourmet dishes at Cuvee 30A, savor Italian favorites at AMICI, or grab a bite at Amigo’s Mexican Kitchen. Morning cravings? Canopy Road Café has you covered, and Goatfeathers Seafood Market is nearby for the freshest catch. The Inlet Beach Underpass is designed for pedestrian and cyclist safety at the intersection of Highway 98 and 30A and it provides a safe crossing beneath busy traffic, connecting beach access, shops and restaurants. It includes art murals by local artists.<br><br>Sea Bliss Cottage is the ideal spot for a weekend escape, a golf trip, or a fun-filled family beach vacation. Book your stay asap and get ready for an unforgettable 30A experience!<br><br>Welcome! Our dedicated team at Oversee 30A, a local company, is committed to ensuring your stay is nothing short of exceptional. We strive for perfection and are just a stone's throw away should you require any assistance. Reach out to us anytime, seven days a week, with the added peace of a 24/7 emergency line.<br><br>Overview:<br>- 3 bedrooms, 2.5 baths<br>- 1,856 square feet<br>- .6 miles to the beach (Wall Street Access)<br>- Wi-Fi and cable<br>- Steps to the seasonally heated community pool<br>- Gas grill<br>- 4 bikes included<br><br>Overnight:<br>- King in 2nd floor primary, private bath, TV<br>- King in 2nd floor guest room, shared bath, TV<br>- Queen in 2nd floor guest room, shared bath, TV<br><br>Check-in is 4:00 PM CST. Checkout is 10:00 AM CST.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
